light> we do not sow), <ref ref=\"Isa 54:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,15)\">Isa 54:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 40:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,23)\">Job 40:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,13)\">2Chr 7:13</ref> (twice in verse) (<ref ref=\"2Chr 7:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,13)\">2Chr 7:13</ref> b <bdbheb>וְאִם</bdbheb>); stating the ground on which a question is based, <ref ref=\"Exod 8:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,22)\">Exod 8:22</ref> (<bdbheb>וְלֹא</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>הֲלֹא</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 3:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,1)\">Jer 3:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hag 2:12\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,12)\">Hag 2:12</ref> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>הֵן</reflink></bdbheb> Aramaic <b>b</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> if, whether, in an indirect question, <ref ref=\"Jer 2:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,10)\">Jer 2:10</ref> <bdbheb>רְאוּ הֵן הָֽיְתָה כָּזֹאת</bdbheb> (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> <bdbheb>הֲנִהְיְתָה</bdbheb>); compare <bdbheb>אִם</bdbheb> <b>2 b</b>, and <bdbheb>הֵן</bdbheb> Aramaic <div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Num 23:9", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 23, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Num 23:24", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 23, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Job 8:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 8, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 8:20", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 8, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Job 13:1", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 13, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Job 26:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 26, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Job 33:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 33, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Job